31,1,1,talk,Minako,,"We have no deaths yet, but we must vote today. Any suspicions?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh dear, it's hard to suspect anyone when everyone is so lovely.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Shizue-san, you're being very vague. That could be a tactic.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I have some very interesting information. I believe Shizue is the werewolf.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"What?! Shizue-san? No way, she's way too nice for that!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Minako,,"Benjamin, are you claiming to be the Seer? That's a bold move on day one.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Oh my, Benjamin-san, I'm quite hurt. I would never do such a thing.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"If Benjamin is the Seer, his information is absolute. But he could be the werewolf lying.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I assure you, my logic is sound and my vision was clear. Shizue is the wolf.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I don't believe it! Benjamin might be trying to trick us!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Minako,,"If Benjamin is the werewolf, he's trying to eliminate a trusted elder.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I only wish for us all to get along. This is very sad.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"The risk of executing a villager is high, but the Seer's lead is strong.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I am happy to be scrutinized, but the truth remains the same.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Kenji,,Let's not vote for Shizue-san! She's too sweet!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Minako,,I'll trust the Seer's claim for now. It's the most direct lead we have.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shizue,,If you all feel it is necessary... I cannot stop you.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I agree with Minako. We follow the Seer's lead.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,A wise decision. Let us end this quickly.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Kenji,,This is wrong! I'm voting against this!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
